1532 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In the face of volatile market behaviour\054 countries will increasingly focus on bolstering energy resiliency within their own borders\056 Across Europe\054 policy has been used to manage the demand\057supply imbalance\054 including managing street lights and illuminated signage\056 The UK and Poland have introduced financial incentives for consumers in a bid to save energy\056\240\nIn 2023\054 the focus must turn to long\055term grid resiliency solutions\054 such as domestic renewable energy generation and bolstering national grid efficiency\056\240)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 1535 0 R
     /Pg 1504 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

