1534 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\054 improved grid efficiency may not only result in greater energy security\054 but also a reduction in electricity pricing by as much as 30\05540\045\056\240\nDistributed Energy Resources \050DERs\051\054 combined with decentralised storage and AI offer a multi\055beneficial way to achieve this\056 The groundwork has already been laid\054 but we can expect increased heavy investment in this technology\056 In time\054 decentralised energy systems will become an indispensable part of the grid\056\240\240)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 1535 0 R
     /Pg 1504 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
