1538 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\015The mass rollout of prosumer technology\054 such as home solar generation and battery storage\054 is one gateway to making DERs a reality\056\240\nProsumer technology is quickly becoming more efficient and less costly\054 and improvements in AI are making the benefits more real for consumers\056 We\031re moving toward a world where connected tech will enable peer\055to\055peer microgrids and energy trading\056 AI will accelerate efforts to serve smart cities with this technology\054 going so far as to offer two\055way charging stations via electric vehicles\056 As partners in the energy transition\054 consumers and policymakers alike will be interested not only in energy security within national borders\054 but also within the home\056\240)
     /K [ 19 ]
     /P 1539 0 R
     /Pg 1504 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
