1556 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\015As 2030 nears\054 clean and affordable energy targets are looming larger\056 Legislation from institutions like the UN\054 IRENA and government coalitions is putting pressure on organisations to transition to the green energy future\056\240\nIn the US\054 22 states plus Washington DC have set up enabling policies for community solar\056 The Biden administration has offered a solar investment tax credit\054 and private sector investment in renewables is expected to explode in 2023\056 We can expect to see government policies that directly shape the energy industry and its outcomes\240toward a greener future in most developed countries\056\240)
     /K [ 33 ]
